<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET RAIN DELAYS ENGLAND INNINGS VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET RAIN DELAYS ENGLAND INNINGS VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND, New Zealand 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain has delayed play in the second one-day cricket international between New Zealand and England at Eden Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>England were on 47 without loss after six overs in response to New Zealand's 253 for eight.</p>
